Enhances: fprintd
Description: CanvasBio CB2000 fingerprint sensor driver (libfprint TOD module)
 Driver for the CanvasBio CB2000 fingerprint sensor (USB 2df0:0003), found in
 Samsung Galaxy Book2 360 and Book3 360 laptops. It is loaded by the
 distribution's libfprint through TOD, so the system libfprint is not replaced.
 .
 The 80x64 frame is too small for libfprint's minutiae matcher, so the driver
 matches with code written independently for this project, using documented
 behavior of the sensor's Windows matching engine as its compatibility
 target.
